   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "decode AI = H_q/H_kv (FLOP/B) vs A100 ridge ~200: all memory-bound.\nMLA absorbed decode ~ 2*n_h*(576+512)/(2*576) ~ 242 FLOP/B (derived):\nit trades bytes for FLOPs and lands near the ridge.\nDeepSeek-V2: 93.3% KV reduction vs DeepSeek 67B, 5.76x max throughput.",
   "originalText": "decode AI = H_q/H_kv (FLOP/B) vs A100 ridge ~200: all memory-bound.\nMLA absorbed decode ~ 2*n_h*(576+512)/(2*576) ~ 242 FLOP/B (derived):\nit trades bytes for FLOPs and lands near the ridge.\nDeepSeek-V2: 93.3% KV reduction vs DeepSeek 67B, 5.76x max throughput.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e275",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
