   "text": "MLA attacks H_kv * d_h TOGETHER (DeepSeek-V2, n_h = d_h = 128):\n2 * n_h * d_h = 2 * 128 * 128 = 32,768 -> d_c + d_R = 512 + 64 = 576\n= 1.76% (~57x), cached as c^KV + k^R",
   "originalText": "MLA attacks H_kv * d_h TOGETHER (DeepSeek-V2, n_h = d_h = 128):\n2 * n_h * d_h = 2 * 128 * 128 = 32,768 -> d_c + d_R = 512 + 64 = 576\n= 1.76% (~57x), cached as c^KV + k^R",
