  {
   "id": "e360",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1110,
   "y": 3165.0,
   "width": 551.1999999999999,
   "height": 80.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1990007125,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1965863886,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A 1-D 'diversity' axis fails for MLA: it does not reduce\nhead count, it changes WHAT is cached (a learned low-rank\nlatent c^KV, up-projected to per-head K/V when needed).\nSo a good MLA can sit above the MHA->MQA curve.",
   "originalText": "A 1-D 'diversity' axis fails for MLA: it does not reduce\nhead count, it changes WHAT is cached (a learned low-rank\nlatent c^KV, up-projected to per-head K/V when needed).\nSo a good MLA can sit above the MHA->MQA curve.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e359",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e361",
