   "versionNonce": 1133573757,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ladder: MHA 8,192 -> GQA-8 2,048 -> MLA 576 -> MQA 256.\nMLA caches MORE than MQA here (576 vs 256), but each of the 32 heads\nstill gets its own K/V view (own W^UK_i, W^UV_i); in MQA all 32 heads\nsee the identical K,V. MLA budget = GQA with 576/256 = 2.25 KV heads.\nDeepSeek-V2 itself has n_h = 128, so there the ratio is\n2*128*128 / 576 = 32,768 / 576 = 57x (sections 1-2).",
   "originalText": "Ladder: MHA 8,192 -> GQA-8 2,048 -> MLA 576 -> MQA 256.\nMLA caches MORE than MQA here (576 vs 256), but each of the 32 heads\nstill gets its own K/V view (own W^UK_i, W^UV_i); in MQA all 32 heads\nsee the identical K,V. MLA budget = GQA with 576/256 = 2.25 KV heads.\nDeepSeek-V2 itself has n_h = 128, so there the ratio is\n2*128*128 / 576 = 32,768 / 576 = 57x (sections 1-2).",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e648",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e650",
