   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e707",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1110,
   "y": 5610.0,
   "width": 850.0,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1084218087,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 144810112,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Low-rank view: [k^C_1..k^C_32 ; v_1..v_32] = W^U c^KV,   W^U in R^(8,192 x 512)\n=> a token's 8,192 K/V numbers live in a 512-dim subspace (rank <= 512).\nThe '2' disappears: K and V are both decoded from the SAME c^KV.\nDecode trick (absorption): score_i = (W^UK_i^T q^C_i)^T c^KV + (q^R_i)^T k^R\n  -> attend directly against the cached 512-dim c^KV; k^C_i and v_i are never materialised.\nWhy a separate k^R: RoPE(pos) sits between q and W^UK, so W^UK could not be absorbed into W^Q.",
   "originalText": "Low-rank view: [k^C_1..k^C_32 ; v_1..v_32] = W^U c^KV,   W^U in R^(8,192 x 512)\n=> a token's 8,192 K/V numbers live in a 512-dim subspace (rank <= 512).\nThe '2' disappears: K and V are both decoded from the SAME c^KV.\nDecode trick (absorption): score_i = (W^UK_i^T q^C_i)^T c^KV + (q^R_i)^T k^R\n  -> attend directly against the cached 512-dim c^KV; k^C_i and v_i are never materialised.\nWhy a separate k^R: RoPE(pos) sits between q and W^UK, so W^UK could not be absorbed into W^Q.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e706",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
