  {
   "id": "e991",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 10,
   "y": 7555.0,
   "width": 1174.0,
   "height": 56.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1095562936,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1411102439,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Bandwidth_KV is proportional to KV size: shrinking the cache 4x (GQA-8) or 14x (MLA) shrinks the per-step read by the same factor.\nWith MHA the KV read (11 ms) is already bigger than the weight read (9 ms); with GQA-8 / MLA the weights dominate again,\nand the freed HBM lets the batch grow, which amortises the weight read.  Decode is memory-bandwidth bound, so bytes = latency.",
   "originalText": "Bandwidth_KV is proportional to KV size: shrinking the cache 4x (GQA-8) or 14x (MLA) shrinks the per-step read by the same factor.\nWith MHA the KV read (11 ms) is already bigger than the weight read (9 ms); with GQA-8 / MLA the weights dominate again,\nand the freed HBM lets the batch grow, which amortises the weight read.  Decode is memory-bandwidth bound, so bytes = latency.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e990",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e992",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 7680,
   "width": 1759.6000000000001,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87546027,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 87298718,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "11. Where this sits: the architecture decides HOW MUCH KV; the rest decides WHERE it lives and HOW FAST it is read",
   "originalText": "11. Where this sits: the architecture decides HOW MUCH KV; the rest decides WHERE it lives and HOW FAST it is read",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
