   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MHA / GQA / MLA decide the representation and AMOUNT of KV;  PagedAttention decides how it is physically allocated;\nblock sharing removes duplicate KV;  FlashAttention decides how efficiently the GPU consumes it.",
   "originalText": "MHA / GQA / MLA decide the representation and AMOUNT of KV;  PagedAttention decides how it is physically allocated;\nblock sharing removes duplicate KV;  FlashAttention decides how efficiently the GPU consumes it.",
