   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KV_MHA = 2*H*d_h = 8,192    |    KV_GQA = 2*G*d_h = 2,048    |    KV_MQA = 2*d_h = 256    |    KV_MLA ~ d_c + d_R = 576\n(numbers per token per layer for H = 32, G = 8, d_h = 128, d_c = 512, d_R = 64;  bytes = x L x T x B x S)",
   "originalText": "KV_MHA = 2*H*d_h = 8,192    |    KV_GQA = 2*G*d_h = 2,048    |    KV_MQA = 2*d_h = 256    |    KV_MLA ~ d_c + d_R = 576\n(numbers per token per layer for H = 32, G = 8, d_h = 128, d_c = 512, d_R = 64;  bytes = x L x T x B x S)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
